###############################################################################
# OCCULT - .gitignore for a ModuleManager patch mod for Kerbal Space Program
###############################################################################

## Release output
# Zips built for CurseForge/SpaceDock/GitHub releases, and any staging folder
# they are assembled from.
build/
dist/
release/
*.zip

## IDE / editor cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.iml
.settings/
.metadata/
.classpath
.project

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## KSP runtime artefacts
# Written by the game into the install directory when testing patches there.
# The ModuleManager caches in particular are large, regenerated on every load,
# and reveal the full mod list of whoever happened to build them.
ModuleManager.ConfigCache
ModuleManager.ConfigSHA
ModuleManager.Physics
ModuleManager.TechTree
ModuleManager*.log
PartDatabase.cfg
KSP.log
Player.log
output_log.txt
*.craft.bak
logs/

## Crash artefacts, wherever they land
crash-reports/
*.dmp

###############################################################################
# Local-only reference material. NOT for publication.
#
# These hold third-party mod configs and assets, kept locally so patches can be
# written and tested against the real thing. They are other people's work under
# other people's licences, several of which forbid redistribution. This mod
# ships none of them, only patches that reference them by name.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
# See NOTICE.
###############################################################################
external-files/
NOTES.md
